  "notes": "Backlog game, picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year (docs/PLAN.md section 2 ordering). StrategyWiki has no page under \"Gothic 1 Remake\" or \"Gothic Remake\". gothic.fandom.com redirects \"Gothic 1 Remake\" to \"Gothic 1 (Remake)\", a page in Category:Article stubs with only 3 links (2 of them to articles); names only were looked at, nothing copied. RAWG lists two developers, Piranha Bytes and Alkimia Interactive; the Fandom infobox names only Alkimia Interactive. Steam app 1297900 is the only store match. 1 of 42 Steam achievements is hidden (the completionist one); the story achievements are \"Complete Chapter 2\" to \"Complete Chapter 6\" plus the Sleeper Temple, so there is no Chapter 1 achievement. The camp achievements (join Old, New or Swamp Camp) are alternatives; a player may not get all three in one run, which was not checked. \"Mercy Over Madness\" (spare Gomez) was put in camps and quests."
